## 📋 What Runs Where (Final Breakdown)

### ✅ Runs Locally in Browser

| Feature | Technology | Speed Gain |
|---------|-----------|------------|
| JavaScript execution | Sandboxed `<iframe>` with `postMessage` API | 300ms → **< 5ms** |
| TypeScript execution | TypeScript compiler loaded from CDN → transpile → run as JS | 500ms → **< 20ms** |
| Python execution | Pyodide (CPython compiled to WASM) | 1000ms → **50-200ms** |
| Note CRUD (create, read, update, delete) | RxDB → IndexedDB | 200ms → **< 5ms** |
| Folder management | RxDB → IndexedDB | 200ms → **< 5ms** |
| Trash & Restore | RxDB → IndexedDB | 200ms → **< 5ms** |
| User settings | RxDB → IndexedDB (or localStorage for tiny items) | 100ms → **< 1ms** |
| Search notes | RxDB full-text queries on IndexedDB | 300ms → **< 10ms** |
| Offline mode | Service Worker + RxDB | ❌ → **✅ Full** |

### ☁️ Stays on Render.com Server (Current Setup Unchanged)

| Feature | Why It Can't Be Local |
|---------|----------------------|
| **C execution** (`gcc`) | GCC compiler is ~200MB+ — impossible to load in browser |
| **C++ execution** (`g++`) | Same as C — G++ is too massive for WASM |
| **Java execution** (`javac` + `java`) | JDK is ~300MB+ — far too heavy for browser |
| **User authentication** | Passwords, OAuth secrets must stay on a trusted server |
| **Google OAuth** | Google requires server-side callback URL + client secret |
| **Email (nodemailer)** | SMTP credentials must be server-side |
| **Gemini AI Service** | API key must be hidden from browser (security) |
| **Note sharing/collaboration** | Central server needed to mediate between users |
| **Admin panel** | Server-side admin operations with elevated permissions |
| **Cron jobs** | Background cleanup tasks need always-on server |

